+## 5. Verification
+
+### 5.1 Before (old chart.js on the 2026-10-16 crawl)
+Measured in Chromium with `docs/process/scripts/viz-even-measure.mjs`: each board's default chart (Clusters,
+grouped by department) at 1440x900 and 390x844, the drawn circles read from the page, and the chart's own
+rows and postings recorded by a hook in a served copy of chart.js. "Off" is the distance between a circle and
+the median midpoint of the postings it stands for, weighted by postings. A "mode" is one exact midpoint carried
+by at least 3 postings and 5% of its row; "merged" counts modes that share a circle with another mode.
